Description: Pirate Arcade — a pirate-themed arcade game collection
 A collection of pirate-themed arcade games including Cannonball Clash
 (paddle ball), Treasure Cove (brick breaker), Kraken's Wake (space
 shooter), and Port Royale Tycoon (Monopoly-style strategy), optimized
 for modern hardware with glow effects, particles, and smooth rendering.
